title: Keep and restore sandbox history tasks
status: draft
created: 2026-11-24
author: Luke Carrier
items[9]{id,title,description,criteria,complexity,effort,dependencies,refs}:
  T-001,"[x] Per-VCS config string","Add `config: Option<String>` to `GitVcsConfig` and `JjVcsConfig`. Git writes the string to an overlay beside Litterbox's bare clone and points `include.path` at it with `--replace-all`. jj writes the file named by `jj config path --repo`. Both validate with the tool before use and replace the overlay on every open. Refuse the Git key when `snapshot-mode = 'direct'`.","`GitVcsConfig` and `JjVcsConfig` parse `config` and reject unknown keys. A Git config sets `gc.reflogExpire` and `git config --get` reads it. A jj TOML config sets a value and `jj config list --repo` reads it. An invalid string fails naming the section. Reopening replaces the overlay. `direct` refuses before any write.","medium","4-6h",,"per-vcs-configuration,config-under-direct,config-ownership,empty-config,invalid-config"
  T-002,"[x] Neutral history and restore contract","Add `src/vcs/history.rs` with `HistoryStep` and `Restored`. Replace `Vcs::history` and `Vcs::restore` signatures. Delete `HistoryPolicy` and `RestoreMode` from `vcs/conflict.rs` and their exports. Implement the new methods in the `vcs/mod.rs` stub and `testing/vcs.rs`.","`cargo check -p agentkit-litterbox` passes. The trait stays object safe. No Git or jj type appears in a signature. The stub and `TestVcs` implement both methods. No caller still names `HistoryPolicy` or `RestoreMode`.","medium","2-3h",,"history-command,restore-forward"
  T-003,"[x] Git history","Add `src/vcs/git/history.rs`. Read `refs/heads/litterbox/<name>` with `Repository::reflog`, newest first. Skip deleted entries and missing commits. Collapse consecutive repeats. Mark a step named by the synced reflog. Return `HistoryStep` with the commit, time and reflog message.","A test snapshots three times and sees step 1 as the branch tip and the two previous tips. A rewritten branch still lists the pre-rewrite tips. A missing object is skipped. A synced commit is marked. No file, ref or workspace changes. The Git suite passes.","medium","3-4h",T-002,"git-log,history-lists,empty-log,missing-target"
  T-004,"[x] Git restore","Add `src/vcs/git/restore.rs`. Peel the target tree. If the tip tree equals the target tree, align the sandbox ref and `synced` to the tip and create no commit. Otherwise create one commit with the target tree and the tip as parent, move the branch with `reference_matching`, then write the sandbox ref and `synced`. Refuse a target tree with conflict markers.","A restore adds exactly one commit whose tree equals the target and whose parent is the old tip. The branch, sandbox ref and `synced` move to it. A no-op creates no commit. A marker target is refused. A moved branch returns `Raced`. A test asserts no new ref.","high","6-8h",T-002,"restore-forward,no-new-store,restore-races"
  T-005,"[ ] jj history","Add `src/vcs/jj/history.rs`. List operations with `jj op log -T`. Resolve the bookmark at each operation with `--at-op` and `--ignore-working-copy`. Skip operations where the bookmark did not exist or did not move. Return newest first with the commit, time and description. Cap the scan and report the cap.","A test with two sandboxes lists only the named bookmark's steps. An operation that moved another bookmark is absent. Listing creates no operation and changes no workspace. A pruned prefix lists what remains.","high","6-8h",T-002,"jj-log,jj-scoped,pruned-jj-log"
  T-006,"[ ] jj restore","Add `src/vcs/jj/restore.rs`. Refuse a missing sandbox workspace with the repair remedy. Refuse a conflicted shared commit. If the sandbox working copy already has the target tree and descends from the tip, create no commit. Otherwise run `jj new <tip> -m`, `jj restore --from <target>`, move the bookmark and write `synced`.","A restore creates one new working-copy commit with the target tree, moves the bookmark and `synced`, and leaves the other sandbox in the clone untouched. A conflicted tip is refused even with a discard flag. A missing workspace is refused. No repository-wide operation runs.","high","8-10h",T-002,"jj-log,jj-conflicted-tip,missing-workspace,jj-scoped"
  T-007,"[ ] Orchestrator history and restore","Add `src/orchestrator/history.rs`. Resolve a step number or commit ID. Force an observation of the workspace. Refuse `diverged`, unsaved work or a staging workspace without `--discard-work`, and an open resolution without `--discard-resolution`. Materialise the target tree, upload it and delete the paths the old tree had. Call `Vcs::restore`. Clear the merge or resolution record. Return a `HistoryRestore` outcome. Refuse a missing jj workspace.","History and restore work through `Sandboxes`. A diverged sandbox refuses and writes nothing. With the flag it restores and clears the merge. A resolving sandbox refuses and clears only with the flag. The workspace holds the target tree after a restore. A failed ref move names the refs written and a retry converges. A paused sandbox restores.","high","1-1.5d","T-003,T-004,T-005,T-006","restore-workspace,restore-guards,history-states,divergence-guarded,resolution-guarded"
  T-008,"[ ] CLI and docs","Add `history <name>` and `restore <name> <step>` to `src/cli.rs` with `--json`, `--discard-work` and `--discard-resolution`. Print step number, commit ID, time and description. Regenerate the command line reference. Update `reference/config.mdx` for the `config` key and add a history page.","The commands appear in `docgen cli`. `history` prints the current tip as step 1 and the older steps below. `restore 2` restores step 2 and prints the new commit. A missing flag prints the refusal and the remedy. `--json` carries the same facts. The docs name the forward commit, the guards and the per-VCS config.","medium","6-8h",T-007,"operator-surface,documentation"
  T-009,"[ ] Verification","Run the gates and the smoke on a scratch repository. Update the spec status to implemented when the tasks land.","The four gates pass. The smoke covers create, three snapshots, history, restore to step 2, a clean next plan, the config string under remote, its refusal under direct, and jj with two sandboxes where the other is untouched. The spec status is `implemented`.","medium","3-4h",T-008,"gates-pass,git-localities,jj-scoped,pruning-is-vcs"
